WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
In the dairy barn, a White Leaf fixture shines continuous blue light into the water trough

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.810
where the herd drinks every day.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.270
That low-level violet-blue light is deadly to bacteria,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.810
yet safe for continuous exposure, and harmless to people and animals.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.630
Patented optics direct about 95% of the light into the trough,

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.550
continuously sanitizing the water and keeping bacterial counts low,

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.450
so every sip the cows take is cleaner, safer drinking water.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.830
White Leaf Technology Group.
